# Testing Rules

- Run `npx tsc --noEmit` and `npm run lint` before finishing
- Unit test pure functions in `lib/metrics/` and `lib/status/`
- Test skill-fit scoring with edge cases (no skills, over-qualified, zero availability)
- Test summary generation with empty weekly statuses
- Prefer testing business logic over snapshot-testing entire pages

```bash
npx tsc --noEmit
npm run lint
```
